 170:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/queue.c ****  * prevent an ISR from adding or removing items to the queue, but does prevent
 171:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/queue.c ****  * an ISR from removing tasks from the queue event lists.  If an ISR finds a
 172:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/queue.c ****  * queue is locked it will instead increment the appropriate queue lock count
 173:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/queue.c ****  * to indicate that a task may require unblocking.  When the queue in unlocked
 174:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/queue.c ****  * these lock counts are inspected, and the appropriate action taken.
 175:Middlewares/FreeRTOS/Source/queue.c ****  */
